---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const appendix = catalog.parts[6].units[4];
---

<nav class="appendix-contents" aria-labelledby="appendix-e-contents-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-e-contents-title">附录目录 | Appendix contents</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#reference-orientation">使用定位 | Reference orientation</a></li>
    <li><a href="#source-map">来源地图 | Source map</a></li>
    <li><a href="#objects-and-conventions">对象、单位与约定 | Objects, units, and conventions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-e-1">E.1 物质中的电磁波 | Electromagnetic waves in matter</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-e-2">E.2 电导与介电张量 | Conductivity and dielectric tensors</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-e-3">E.3 f-sum rule | The f sum rule</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-e-4">E.4 标量纵向介电函数 | Scalar longitudinal dielectric functions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-e-5">E.5 张量横向介电函数 | Tensor transverse dielectric functions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-e-6">E.6 晶格介电贡献 | Lattice dielectric contribution</a></li>
    <li><a href="#review">交叉引用、误判、练习与来源 | Review and sources</a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="appendix-e-source-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-e-source-title">来源地图 | Source map</h2>
  <p>
    下表记录 Martin Appendix E 的原节标题与印刷页定位。网站正文、推导、图形和练习均为原创，不转录教材正文、原图或练习。
  </p>
  <p lang="en">
    The table records the section titles and printed-page locators of Martin Appendix E. Website exposition, derivations, diagrams, and exercises are original and do not reproduce the textbook body, source figures, or exercises.
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>原书位置 | Source locator</th>
        <th>原节标题 | Source section</th>
        <th>网站覆盖 | Website coverage</th>
        <th>状态 | State</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {appendix.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}, printed p. {section.page}</td>
          <td>{section.title}</td>
          <td>
            {section.id === 'E.1'
              ? 'Maxwell 方程、内外源、极化、D 场与连续性方程'
              : section.id === 'E.2'
                ? '非局域电导/介电张量、总场与外场响应、宏观平均'
                : section.id === 'E.3'
                  ? '高频自由电子极限、plasma frequency 与光谱权重守恒'
                  : section.id === 'E.4'
                    ? '纵向标量势、χ/χ⁰、介电矩阵、local-field corrections 与长波极限'
                    : section.id === 'E.5'
                      ? 'vector potential、current response、横向电磁波与 current-DFT 边界'
                      : 'Born effective charge、非解析力常数、晶格介电和 proper piezoelectric response'}
          </td>
          <td>substantive draft</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
      <tr>
        <td>Exercises, printed p. {appendix.exercisesPage}</td>
        <td>Source exercises not reproduced</td>
        <td>原创 convention、sum-rule、matrix inversion、LO–TO 与单位检查 | Original convention, sum-rule, matrix-inversion, LO–TO, and unit checks</td>
        <td>original replacement</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<style>
  .appendix-contents {
    margin-block: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
  }

  .appendix-contents h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .appendix-contents ol { columns: 2; column-gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .appendix-contents li { break-inside: avoid; margin-block: 0.35rem; }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .appendix-contents ol { columns: 1; }
  }
</style>
